<title>FRANCE: Bouygues H1 sales up 22 pct to 41.7 bln Fr.</title>
<headline>Bouygues H1 sales up 22 pct to 41.7 bln Fr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				   41.7    vs    34.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction company Bouygues gave its figures in a statement. It said group sales, including 6.5 billion from Saur-Cise, rose 22 percent from the year-ago period. On a like-for-like basis, turnover rose three percent, due mainly to the development of international construction activities.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5xxx</p>
</text>
